212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (XGBoost models performed the strongest \(77.51% accuracy, 0.7672 F1, 0.8943 ROC-AUC\), suggesting a strong non-linear relationship between features and that regularization improved overall model performance )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
