225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 441 0 R
/E (The model performance demonstrates how ML can be effectively applied to predict student drop-out rates, with tree-based methods \(e.g., XGBoost\) being the most effective strategies overall. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 442 0 R
